  "implementation_notes": [
    "Earliest-lodging check only; PASS does not establish timely/latest lodging, appointment availability or processing completion.",
    "CLAMP is the implementation convention for impossible target dates, not quoted legal wording. No fixed-day conversion.",
    "Seafarers and other special conditions require review. The unresolved 15-calendar-day/two-week issue is not evaluated."
  ]
